flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase reviewed memory loop
  accDescr: A reviewed owned-run result can propose a scoped lesson. Pending or rejected lessons remain excluded. Only an owner-approved committed version and its provenance can enter the snapshot of a later explicit run; already queued runs retain their earlier context.
  Result["Reviewed result from an owned run"]
  Proposed["Proposed scoped lesson"]
  Decision{{"Owner approves the displayed version?"}}
  Excluded["Excluded from future task context"]
  Committed["Committed approved version and provenance"]
  Next["Next explicit run captures its own snapshot"]
  Result --> Proposed
  Proposed --> Decision
  Decision -->|"No, or still pending"| Excluded
  Decision -->|"Yes, committed"| Committed
  Committed --> Next
  Next -->|"New work and evidence"| Result
